# Line-ending policy — deliberately narrow.
#
# This repository is mixed by history. NexusOps.AppHost/, NexusOps.Server/,
# frontend/ and aspire.config.json were generated by Visual Studio on Windows and
# are stored with CRLF; every other project is stored with LF. Normalising the
# whole tree would rewrite 28 committed files in one go, so it is treated as a
# separate decision and recorded in specs/003-review-remediation/spec.md rather
# than folded in here.
#
# frontend/package-lock.json is the single file stored with LF while all of its
# siblings in frontend/ are stored with CRLF. An `npm install` run from the
# Windows side rewrites all 2,740 lines, producing a ~5,500-line diff in which
# only ~13 lines are real content. Pin it so that cannot recur.
frontend/package-lock.json text eol=lf
